title: 'pallet-revive: drop cfg-gated host functions from the upload import allowlist'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    `list_syscalls()` now respects each host function's `#[cfg]`. Before this, builds without
    `runtime-benchmarks` still listed the benchmark-only `noop` syscall, so uploads importing it
    were accepted and then trapped with `InvalidSyscall` when called. Such uploads are now
    rejected with `CodeRejected`. `lookup_syscall_index` derives its indices from the filtered
    list. The trace op list is unchanged.
crates:
- name: pallet-revive-proc-macro
  bump: patch
- name: pallet-revive
  bump: patch
